84?s=46", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@deep_4949/works/23", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/f4102a01/uploads/origins/cfc88728-0ade-4619-b4be-088c58e3a9f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=938a6accacd9e381117255214189505f", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/f4102a01/uploads/origins/cfc88728-0ade-4619-b4be-088c58e3a9f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=938a6accacd9e381117255214189505f, https://si.imgix.net/f4102a01/uploads/origins/cfc88728-0ade-4619-b4be-088c58e3a9f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=17f920f75edf443b28e0e2e551c8ff2d 2x, https://si.imgix.net/f4102a01/uploads/origins/cfc88728-0ade-4619-b4be-088c58e3a9f0?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=ef50ea1d65234e39e674ad616d1f89da 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": false, "body": "Deep様\n初めまして。\nRealityで配信をしている今際みつはと申します。\n\n添付させて頂く資料のアバターのイラストを描いて頂きたいです。\nモチーフは🤍☘️、キャラクターはお姉さん・メンヘラです。\n可能であれば｢2024.9.1 デビュグラ6位ありがとう｣の文言を入れて頂きたいです。構図等は一切お任せします。\n宜しくお願い致します。\n\n今際みつは\n\nhttps://x.com/imawa_mitsuha/status/1837466751438934447?s=46&t=PYhxKyIi5F-SnRNkjkvwiw", "created_at": "", "completed_at": ""}, {"path": "/@deep_4949/works/22", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf7f805/uploads/origins/20fc4b1e-1d0e-4b60-abf1-c79a906e3726?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a1e416831dde3990e6f53f5a563fcae5", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/ecf7f805/uploads/origins/20fc4b1e-1d0e-4b60-abf1-c79a906e3726?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&px=200&txtfont=bold&txtshad=50&txtclr=FFFFFF&txtalign=middle%2Ccenter&txtsize=30&txt=PRIVATE&s=a1e416831dde3990e6f53f5a563fcae5, https://si.imgix.net/ecf7f805/uploads/origins/20fc4b1e-1d0e-4b60-abf1-c79a906e3726?bg=%23fff&auto=format%